OL,3,GNEWSAEx-councillor guilty of sex crimes
OL,4,Aagainst cadets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former city councillor has been
OL,7,Fconvicted of child sexual offences,
OL,8,Fmany involving boys he had instructed
OL,9,Fas an army cadet leader.
OL,11,FA jury at Ipswich Crown Court found
OL,12,FRylan Ray guilty of 22 crimes including
OL,13,Fsexual assault and sexual activity with
OL,14,Fa child. He had already admitted five
OL,15,Ffurther offences at an earlier hearing.
OL,17,FThe case involved teenagers the former
OL,18,FConservative politician had met through
OL,19,Fhis role with the Cambridgeshire Army
OL,20,FCadet Force and took place over a
OL,21,Fsix-year period.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
